Verify exactly one parseable formula, 6,000 uL subtotal, no current raw aliquot below 10 uL, no depleted materials, one musk exactly, no duplicate canonical identities, and no more than six declared structural OAV<1 rows.

- [ ] **Step 2: Verify spec coverage and claim ceilings**

Confirm the packet contains:

- target identity and DHP-theory architecture before dosing;
- separate ideal and current formula presentations;
- ppm, ODT, OAV, composite-natural handling, and temporal diagnostics;
- exact stock preparations;
- missing-chemical impact and bounded purchase recommendations;
